          "y": 150,
          "w": 130,
          "h": 12,
          "text": "One drag: rinse, blot, box",
          "translations": {
            "zh": "拖一次：冲水、吸油、装木盒"
          },
          "style": "caption",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "p3",
          "x": 35,
          "y": 168,
          "w": 253,
          "h": 44,
          "text": "Nine heavy dishes have an uptown version. Uptown orders (15%) only take boxed meals and pay 4x.",
          "translations": {
            "zh": "9 道重油菜有上城版。上城单（约 15%）只收木盒外卖，按平台价 ×4 付。"
          },
          "style": "body"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "p4",
          "x": 35,
          "y": 212,
          "w": 253,
          "h": 44,
          "text": "Put water in the station's water slot: 300 ml a dish. Boxes and paper are station stock. 10% aren't rinsed clean: check the tooltip.",
          "translations": {
            "zh": "台上水格放水，每份冲 300 毫升。木盒、吸油纸是台上计数，下单机补。每份 10% 手抖没冲干净，看悬停提示。"
          },
          "style": "body"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "s3",
          "x": 35,
          "y": 258,
          "w": 253,
          "h": 14,
          "text": "3. Heartburn",
          "translations": {
            "zh": "3. 烧心值"
          },
          "style": "section",
          "color": "#355271"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "p5",
          "x": 35,
          "y": 276,
          "w": 253,
          "h": 60,
          "text": "Uptown has one extra demand: no heartburn after eating. ≤15: good review. Up to 40: a forum rant, uptown reputation down. Above: acute pancreatitis, the legal team claims 3x the uptown price.",
          "translations": {
            "zh": "上层区额外要求吃了不烧心。≤15：好评。16–40：论坛小作文，上层区声望下降。超过 40：急性胰腺炎，私人法务索赔上城价 ×3。"
          },
          "style": "body"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "note2",
          "x": 135,
          "y": 336,
          "w": 160,
          "h": 30,
          "text": "The box takes \"seasoning\" too.",
          "translations": {
            "zh": "木盒里照样能加“调味料”。"
          },
          "style": "handwritten",
          "align": "center",
          "color": "#a8641e",
          "fontSize": 9
        }
